cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use sprinx, please cite it using these metadata.
title: sprinx
abstract: >-
  Assigns Sprinzl coordinates to cytosolic and mitochondrial tRNA sequences
  by aligning each to an appropriate covariance model and interpreting the
  resulting structure alignment.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mishra
    given-names: Swastik
    email: swastik.mishra@uni-heidelberg.de
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-4107-6384
  - family-names: Dieterich
    given-names: Christoph
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9468-6311
repository-code: https://github.com/dieterich-lab/sprinx
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - tRNA
  - Sprinzl numbering
  - covariance model
  - sequence annotation
